#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: diluxone-offload.php
msgid "DiluxOne Offload – Multi-Cloud Media Storage"
msgstr "DiluxOne Offload – Multi-Cloud Media Storage"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: diluxone-offload.php
msgid "https://github.com/soydiloreto/diluxone-offload-wordpress"
msgstr "https://github.com/soydiloreto/diluxone-offload-wordpress"

#. Description of the plugin
#: diluxone-offload.php
msgid ""
"Move your WordPress media to cloud object storage and serve it from there. "
"Replaces the /uploads/ directory transparently, via PHP stream wrappers."
msgstr ""
"Mova os seus ficheiros multimédia do WordPress para armazenamento de objetos "
"na nuvem e sirva-os a partir daí. Substitui a pasta /uploads/ de forma "
"transparente, através de stream wrappers de PHP."

